WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.854 --> 00:00:07.563
Open the site and tap "Try without an account".

2
00:00:08.063 --> 00:00:13.771
Tap "Draw": your first room is ready.

3
00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:19.971
Choose a shape, for example a rectangle.

4
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:26.183
Tap a wall and type the length.

5
00:00:26.683 --> 00:00:32.389
The drawing adjusts to scale straight away.

6
00:00:32.889 --> 00:00:39.467
Create an account to keep your work safe.

